            "id": "686252701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "克霍讷之墓",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>愿小阿德娜的睡梦中永远有鲜花与糖果。</color>",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "686252702"
            ]
          },
          "686252702": {
            "id": "686252702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "克霍讷之墓",
            "text": "<color=#00E1FFFF>赞美达诺妲与哈马莱宁的勇气，愿他们与女儿一道进入无忧的梦。</color>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7608703",
      "subQuestName": "与哭泣的幽影对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
